iterm-agents is derived from it2ag.

Upstream: https://github.com/mkusaka/it2ag
Author: mkusaka
License: GNU General Public License, version 2

The process scan, iTerm2 toolbelt panel, session list, git and worktree
grouping, click-to-focus, and the Claude Code and Codex activity signals
come from that project.

This repository is separate. It adds recognition for the Cursor Agent CLI,
the Devin CLI, and Kimi Code, and it registers its own toolbelt panel
(`dev.iterm-agents.monitor`) so it can run beside it2ag.
